{"id":"vod_sn_37515","vodId":"37515","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"白领羽球部","name_cn":"白领羽球部","date":"2022-01-01","year":"2022","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/65929a2d004b4ac689e3f2f35a959931.jpg"},"summary":"《Rymans Club》是由榎木淳弥、三木真一郎、石川界人出演，山内爱弥担任监督，LIDEN FILMS负责制作，将在2022年1月于朝日電視台的NUMAnimation”档播出。以天才的观察力，作为羽毛球选手活跃着的白鸟尊。但是，由于高中校际比赛的精神创伤，没能像想象的那样进行比赛。尊被作为社会人选手所属的强队队Mitsuhoshi银行开除了。为了让他作为选手东山再起，而等待着进入日光电视台工作的他对于不习惯的公司职员的工作，没有结果的弱小羽毛球部… 而且，又粗野，声音又大，距离非常近的大叔…宫澄建。原·天才的新人社会人和豪爽大叔〃巴德利人〃。当任何事物都完全相反的组合诞生的时候快要放弃的梦想，再次拉开了帷幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:53:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/m6BBg2wXDv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kXA5WH3bur1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kmqgTH4vrR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iTgc0hSbjW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DDrfQ9jUM11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0KyzSnukwE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ysrSba6DRp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZCWSmSu8CQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/d2CzFDQ4Q41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xzDzZ0w03U1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8N6JTK02PU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GGdpHFYQBV1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:10.041Z"}